<title>UK: Last three Dec Brent dates kept - trade.</title>
<headline>Last three Dec Brent dates kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The last three Brent dates due to be nominated from the December paper chain were kept ahead of the five-o'clock deadline, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The cargoes were kept by J.P.Morgan, Vitol, and Phibro, they said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
